    size: 4x4 [observed]
    colors: 2-3 distinct colors
    symmetry: NOT left-right symmetric (ensures non-trivial output)
  output:
    size: same height as tile, width = 5 * tile width
    construction: 5 horizontal copies [original, LR-flipped, original, LR-flipped, original]
  transform: concatenate tile and its LR mirror in alternating ABABA pattern

